    title: "rust-analyzer's success path returns run=None and translate fabricates a throwaway AnalysisRun to satisfy Edge's guard: 669 nodes + 637 edges orphaned, 1308 violations, and the pass is in neither accounting bucket"  # aa23
    status: todo_hard  # aa23
